+### §viewport-media-query — the shell responds to the viewport width
+- Since: 2026-10-23
+- Supersedes: §container-not-viewport (2026-09-15), overridden by the maintainer.
+- Decision: the shell's layout step uses a viewport `@media (min-width: 720px)` query.
+- Reason: maintainer decision to use plain viewport media queries.
+- Known risk: the shell renders inside split panes as narrow as 380px on a 1440px screen. A viewport query picks the
+  two-column layout inside a narrow pane and can clip the sidebar again (the cause of incident 2026-09-14, which
+  motivated the superseded `@container` decision).
